    {
      "subId": "100001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10000101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10000101": {
            "id": "10000101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If you wanna find the Geo Archon, this is the only chance you'll get all year.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000102"
            ]
          },
          "10000102": {
            "id": "10000102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Guess it's a good thing Venti brought it up earlier, otherwise we definitely would've missed this year's Rite of Descension.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000104",
              "10000106"
            ]
          },
          "10000104": {
            "id": "10000104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uhh... might be today, might also be tomorrow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000107"
            ]
          },
          "10000107": {
            "id": "10000107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Look, we're already in Liyue so let's go ask some of the locals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000108"
            ]
          },
          "10000108": {
            "id": "10000108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, right. About the Geo Archon, \"Morax...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000109"
            ]
          },
          "10000109": {
            "id": "10000109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Did you know? The Mora that we use is named after this god.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000110"
            ]
          },
          "10000110": {
            "id": "10000110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But it's seen as impolite for people from outside Liyue to refer to the Geo Archon by that name.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000111"
            ]
          },
          "10000111": {
            "id": "10000111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So we should refer to the Geo Archon by the name Rex Lapis, like the people of Liyue do."
          },
          "10000106": {
            "id": "10000106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, Venti brought up the time, but Paimon... knows nothing about where it is... Ehe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "100002",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the locals",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10000201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10000201": {
            "id": "10000201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Oh! Are you also visitors here for the Rite of Descension?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000202"
            ]
          },
          "10000202": {
            "id": "10000202",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "To think I've lived in Liyue all these years and never come to see this before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000203"
            ]
          },
          "10000203": {
            "id": "10000203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "I guess it's like they say. Locals never visit the tourist spots.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000204"
            ]
          },
          "10000204": {
            "id": "10000204",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "I wish you well on your travels! Liyue always welcomes you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "100003",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the locals",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10000301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10000301": {
            "id": "10000301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Rite of Descension... Oh yeah, that reminds me, isn't that today?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000302"
            ]
          },
          "10000302": {
            "id": "10000302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Once a year, Rex Lapis bestows upon us his divine prediction, guiding us on how to run Liyue for the coming year.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000303"
            ]
          },
          "10000303": {
            "id": "10000303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Last year it was the Yuheng of the Liyue Qixing that was given the honor of asking for the divine prediction.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000306"
            ]
          },
          "10000306": {
            "id": "10000306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh! Paimon knows this one!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000307"
            ]
          },
          "10000307": {
            "id": "10000307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Mondstadt is to freedom as Liyue is to contracts. Liyue has a strong focus on business and trade.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000308"
            ]
          },
          "10000308": {
            "id": "10000308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Liyue Qixing — the seven leaders of the seven enterprises of Liyue — hold true control over Liyue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000309"
            ]
          },
          "10000309": {
            "id": "10000309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "That's what foreigners always say.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000310"
            ]
          },
          "10000310": {
            "id": "10000310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "But true control over Liyue will always be held by Rex Lapis.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000311"
            ]
          },
          "10000311": {
            "id": "10000311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "The Qixing is comprised of mere mortals. Rex Lapis is a god. Mondstadt's god is nowhere to be seen, whilst our god is forever with us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000312"
            ]
          },
          "10000312": {
            "id": "10000312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Stay in Liyue long enough and you'll see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000313"
            ]
          },
          "10000313": {
            "id": "10000313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Given that you just left your godless city, it's time you experienced what it's like to be in a city whose god has walked with it through all of history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "100004",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the locals",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10000401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10000401": {
            "id": "10000401",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "You too wish to bear witness to the Rite of Descension? Me too, we all do!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000402"
            ]
          },
          "10000402": {
            "id": "10000402",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "As a businessman myself, how could I not take interest in Liyue's most important business trends?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000403"
            ]
          },
          "10000403": {
            "id": "10000403",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "The seventeen predictions given last year made more than a few ripples throughout the industry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000404"
            ]
          },
          "10000404": {
            "id": "10000404",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "What's more, there has been a rumor going around that the Tianquan herself, Ningguang, has been acting secretly in the shadows...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000405"
            ]
          },
          "10000405": {
            "id": "10000405",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "She wants the rocks created by Geo Vision holders to be exempt from taxation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000406"
            ]
          },
          "10000406": {
            "id": "10000406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow... that's some super professional legal stuff that is!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000407"
            ]
          },
          "10000407": {
            "id": "10000407",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "Haha. To be on the pulse of the predictions and the market is what makes this harbor what it is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000408"
            ]
          },
          "10000408": {
            "id": "10000408",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "Among The Seven, Rex Lapis is the oldest deity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000409"
            ]
          },
          "10000409": {
            "id": "10000409",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "His keen sense of strategy is well trusted among his people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10000410"
            ]
          },
          "10000410": {
            "id": "10000410",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "Understanding the predictions as soon as possible can make all the difference in making your fortune!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
