    {
      "subId": "100013",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the stranger",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10001301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10001301": {
            "id": "10001301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*panting* Phew... Paimon's exhausted...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001304"
            ]
          },
          "10001304": {
            "id": "10001304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So insensitive! You have no idea just how tiring floating arou— Wait!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001305"
            ]
          },
          "10001305": {
            "id": "10001305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Just who are you exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001306"
            ]
          },
          "10001306": {
            "id": "10001306",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Call me Childe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001307"
            ]
          },
          "10001307": {
            "id": "10001307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Childe? What, so we're supposed to dote on you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001308"
            ]
          },
          "10001308": {
            "id": "10001308",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Haha, no no, not at all. It's an alias of sorts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001309"
            ]
          },
          "10001309": {
            "id": "10001309",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "In Mondstadt, I don't suppose you came across a \"Signora\" by any chance?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001310"
            ]
          },
          "10001310": {
            "id": "10001310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Signora... Childe...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001311"
            ]
          },
          "10001311": {
            "id": "10001311",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You're Fatui! One of The Harbingers!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001312"
            ]
          },
          "10001312": {
            "id": "10001312",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Oh, no. Don't worry, I'm not looking for a fight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001313"
            ]
          },
          "10001313": {
            "id": "10001313",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Signora gave you quite the bad impression huh? Tsk, that woman... Can't say I'm a fan either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001314"
            ]
          },
          "10001314": {
            "id": "10001314",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Right, let's forget all about her, shall we? I'm here to help you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "100014",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Childe at the Northland Bank",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10001401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10001401": {
            "id": "10001401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Northland Bank...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001402"
            ]
          },
          "10001402": {
            "id": "10001402",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Correct. This bank was opened here in Liyue by Snezhnaya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001403"
            ]
          },
          "10001403": {
            "id": "10001403",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Though everyone knows Liyue is the most enterprising in Teyvat, Snezhnaya is not short of change either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001404"
            ]
          },
          "10001404": {
            "id": "10001404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah well, poorer nations don't seem the type to have diplomats that come around acting the way yours do towards the Knights of Favonius.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001405"
            ]
          },
          "10001405": {
            "id": "10001405",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Eh-hehehehe...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001406"
            ]
          },
          "10001406": {
            "id": "10001406",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Here, let me give you this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001407"
            ]
          },
          "10001407": {
            "id": "10001407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This is a...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001408"
            ]
          },
          "10001408": {
            "id": "10001408",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "I'm not sure, exactly. Sometimes, all money can buy is \"things\" and not a name for oneself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001409"
            ]
          },
          "10001409": {
            "id": "10001409",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "All I know is that it's a sigil. A sigil to keep the \"mighty and illuminated adepti\" from bringing harm to you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001410"
            ]
          },
          "10001410": {
            "id": "10001410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Adepti?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001411"
            ]
          },
          "10001411": {
            "id": "10001411",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "If you head north from the harbor, then west from Guili Plains, you will eventually reach a stone forest known as Jueyun Karst.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001412"
            ]
          },
          "10001412": {
            "id": "10001412",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "The people of Liyue believe it to be the abode of the adepti.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001415"
            ]
          },
          "10001415": {
            "id": "10001415",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Legend or not, they believe it. As such, offerings to the adepti are made at its borders. Nobody dares venture in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001416"
            ]
          },
          "10001416": {
            "id": "10001416",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "But I have no need for believing — not when I know for a fact that the adepti truly exist.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001417"
            ]
          },
          "10001417": {
            "id": "10001417",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hate to admit it but your Fatui intel seems alright. But, why would we go looking for adepti anyway?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001418"
            ]
          },
          "10001418": {
            "id": "10001418",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Ha, oh my little friend. There are plenty of reasons mortals seek the blessings of adepti.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001419"
            ]
          },
          "10001419": {
            "id": "10001419",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Money, health, love... But you... you will go for justice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001420"
            ]
          },
          "10001420": {
            "id": "10001420",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Justice?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001421"
            ]
          },
          "10001421": {
            "id": "10001421",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "The Qixing will already have dispatched the Millelith. They'll be seeking out the assassin from amongst the onlookers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001422"
            ]
          },
          "10001422": {
            "id": "10001422",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "But how could a mere mortal kill a god that can sweep aside entire armies? Rex Lapis never gave up his power as a god.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10001423"
            ]
          },
          "10001423": {
            "id": "10001423",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "This level of crude response is beyond what is called for. How suspicious..."
          }
        }
      }
